            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Lotte Mall HN",
            "review_text": "Matsuda\nSingapore, Singapore179 contributions\n1\nEye Pleasing Japanese Food\nAug 2024 • Friends\nWe did not have a reservation but managed to get in. Absolutely loveeee this place food!!! Many many choices!!!! Miso crab 🦀 was great!!!\n\nThey offered free appetizer of roasted ginko nuts!!!\n\nMust try the Melon 🍈 juice!!!! Super yummy!! The assorted tempura 🍤 was also great! Plating was an eye pleaser which makes the food really delicious.\n\nAlso the Japanese 🍈 fruit is also good.\n\nPrice was also affordable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 19, 2024",
