            "review_text": "Cao Son\nHanoi, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nNoisy restaurant\nMar 2024 • Family\nThe restaurant is very noisy due to many children. The menu is very diverse, with many dishes, however, this might be a disadvantage as it leads to the restaurant lacking signature dishes. The service is slow, many waiters serve a table but not effectively. Staff run back and forth many times but do not pay attention to the guests or clear the tables. \n\nThe restaurant should have a separate area for families with children, to avoid the noise affecting other customers.\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2024",
